The deferred function of `analyze` called `wg.Done()` before it put its
slot back into `task`. After the last `wg.Done()`, the goroutine that waits
on `wg` can close `task` before that send, which panics with "send on closed
channel". Put the slot back first: `task` has room for it, so the send does
not block.

Upstream: https://github.com/google/licenseclassifier/pull/76

